  "live_records": {
    "q-170735": {
      "dom_id": "step-q170735",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$x$ is rational  **or** greater than $10.$\n\nExpress the compound predicate above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $A(x):$ $x$ is rational\n\n- $B(x):$ $x$ is greater than $10$",
      "worked_solution": "The word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨.$\"\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n$$\n{{x\\text{ is rational}}_{⏟}}_{A}\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{x>10}_{⏟}}_{B},\n$$\n\nthat is, $A∨B.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
