    "q-170725": {
      "dom_id": "step-q170725",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$x$ is even **or** odd.\n\nExpress the compound predicate above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $P(x):$ $x$ is even\n\n- $Q(x):$ $x$ is odd",
      "worked_solution": "The word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨$\".\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n$$\n{{x\\text{ is even}}_{⏟}}_{P}\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{x\\text{ is odd}}_{⏟}}_{Q},\n$$\n\nthat is, $P∨Q.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
