ta-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><munder><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mpadded width=\"0\"><mphantom><mi>p</mi></mphantom></mpadded></mrow><mtext>&nbsp;is less than&nbsp;</mtext><mn>10</mn><mtext>&nbsp;or&nbsp;</mtext><mn>13</mn></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>X</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow></munder><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><munder><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mpadded width=\"0\"><mphantom><mi>p</mi></mphantom></mpadded></mrow><mtext>and</mtext></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∧</mo></mrow></munder><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><munder><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mpadded width=\"0\"><mphantom><mi>p</mi></mphantom></mpadded></mrow><mtext>&nbsp;is an integer</mtext></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mrow><mi>Z</mi></munder><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>that is, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"65\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2227\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo 